assertion  XSH.towctrans.001
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#RETURN VALUE
anchor     basedefs/V1_chap07.html#7.3.1
class      required
says       With the handle from wctrans("toupper") in the POSIX locale,
           towctrans() maps each lowercase letter to its uppercase partner,
           returns all other portable characters unchanged, and agrees with
           towupper() for all 128 characters.
test       t/001-toupper.c

assertion  XSH.towctrans.002
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#RETURN VALUE
anchor     basedefs/V1_chap07.html#7.3.1
class      required
says       With the handle from wctrans("tolower"), towctrans() maps each
           uppercase letter to its lowercase partner, returns all other
           portable characters unchanged, and agrees with towlower() for all
           128 characters.
test       t/002-tolower.c

assertion  XSH.towctrans.003
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
says       With desc equal to zero (wctrans_t)0, towctrans() returns its first
           argument unchanged (checked for a, A, 0, space and WEOF).
test       t/003-zero-desc.c

assertion  XSH.towctrans.004
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#DESCRIPTION
anchor     functions/towctrans.html#RETURN VALUE
class      required
says       With either handle, towctrans(WEOF, desc) returns WEOF.
test       t/004-weof.c
